OL,3,AFive more arrests in fatal A66 crash
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have also been charged, one for
OL,7,Fpossession of a firearm with intent to
OL,8,Fendager life, and one with possession
OL,9,Fwith intent to supply class A and class
OL,10,FB drugs and possession of criminal
OL,11,Fproperty.
OL,13,FAll five of the newly arrested men
OL,14,Fremain in custody.
